 the TipSplitter contract, a full Foundry test suite, independent reviews, GitHub publication and a public website on IPFS to use it. TipSplitter rules: anyone deposits SPLT tips to a pool; a member list is fixed by the first depositor's call registering up to ten members once; members pull their equal share of the pool at any time via pull payments.","types":["contracts","sites"],"audits":[],"release":{"status":"completed","failure":null},"research":[],"versions":[],"contracts":[{"id":"217be56c-a7d6-46d3-8f57-78fc1f6e1f50","kind":"evm_project","token":{"name":"Splitwise","symbol":"SPLT"},"status":"live","chainId":11155111,"artifacts":[{"name":"MerkleDistributor","role":"distributor","txHash":"0xf09424fba8d18416df8cd75532c29dfc27acb34761d6ec1418e5440293f9441b","address":"0xaf273324451ada976bb4ff035c4346ef2d3e4692"},{"name":"Splitwise","role":"token","txHash":"0xf09424fba8d18416df8cd75532c29dfc27acb34761d6ec1418e5440293f9441b","address":"0x6e10b801edf8296afa4584f6fafe5426f2a48169"},{"name":"TipSplitter","role":"other","txHash":"0xf09424fba8d18416df8cd75532c29dfc27acb34761d6ec1418e5440293f9441b","address":"0x62d2b0ea460b772b6f3bdf5ef3eea37149f2e096"}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T15:28:20.042+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T15:29:13.276+00:00","launchNumber":80,"parkedReason":null,"sourceCommit":"a21df802e3cca4a1ae93456b49cbc197bab92de5","sourceRepoUrl":"https://github.com/Identity-md/launch-80-workflow-contract-stage-context"}],"publishedAt":"2026-09-21T15:44:52.576+00:00"},{"id":"workflow:d8f45cc3-4c35-4720-a599-482d1aa31c50","code":[],"media":[],"sites":[{"id":"514c6a6b-c7ad-4dc3-9145-0a55e6118820","cid":"bafybeig4xxfxbhkxsmautrga6yjuqcv76bctmkhj3f7ad2mqfeambtlp6q","jobId":"115a2caa-323b-411a-bc39-e69977e85e34","label":"roll","status":"named","txHash":"0x9d46eec7e6f2cad4ef760022b3edda30cbd85761530934fc3926c40902a25986","ensName":"roll.site.identitymd.eth","failure":null,"namedAt":"2026-09-20T21:22:53.478+00:00","repoUrl":"https://github.com/Identity-md/launch-52-workflow-frontend-stage-context","pinnedAt":"2026-09-20T21:21:24.308+00:00","createdAt":"2026-09-20T21:21:16.28+00:00","supersededBy":null}],"title":"Build a simple crypto game with its own token, deploy it on Sepolia through the network's project factory, publish the source on GitHub, and publish a public website to play it on IPFS. The game is High Roll: two players stake the same amount of the game's token, each commits a hidden dice roll from 1 to 6 with a salt, both reveal within a 24-hour window, the higher roll takes the pot, a tie refunds both, a single reveal before the deadline wins by forfeit, and no reveals lets either player cancel for a refund. No fee, no owner, no admin, no upgradeability. Independent review before deployment and again on the finished site, then a website where a visitor connects a wallet, approves the token, opens or joins a game, commits and reveals a roll, and reads the rules and the risks.","types":["contracts","sites"],"audits":[],"release":{"status":"completed","failure":null},"research":[],"versions":[],"contracts":[{"id":"8b853906-a016-40e5-8ba5-81b37f138ed4","kind":"evm_project","token":{"name":"High Roll","symbol":"ROLL"},"status":"live","chainId":11155111,"artifacts":[{"name":"HighRoll","role":"other","txHash":"0x7e7773d05201e0b54a6def9e0d1e0f3be031185fe0724b8440ae4b8def16fe2c","address":"0x3f621b665c18f8be6c3bd7949badac07f1d8d697"},{"name":"HighRollToken","role":"token","txHash":"0x7e7773d05201e0b54a6def9e0d1e0f3be031185fe0724b8440ae4b8def16fe2c","address":"0x1eb463ff9a7868b05734f42548c593cce5c1f4bb"},{"name":"MerkleDistributor","role":"distributor","txHash":"0x7e7773d05201e0b54a6def9e0d1e0f3be031185fe0724b8440ae4b8def16fe2c","address":"0x524068f87fe6abd2f14a63ae9bee2ae170585d9b"}],"createdAt":"2026-09-20T20:58:04.919+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T20:59:15.882+00:00","launchNumber":51,"parkedReason":null,"sourceCommit":"5a09c993b4baca81c5e942fae236bb495a2ea8bf","sourceRepoUrl":"https://github.com/Identity-md/launch-51-workflow-contract-stage-context"}],"publishedAt":"2026-09-20T21:22:53.478+00:00"},{"id":"workflow:693be293-9467-4909-90c9-143714ade09d","code":[],"media":[],"sites":[{"id":"bf20d852-e55a-403b-9202-9533fa5dd8a3","cid":"bafybeia3ms7cx4g62udg53g6j43g527zd4ahhgznrobk2o2sv2todyh2mq","jobId":"5bdc4b82-ec03-4212-8fd8-20810e82218c","label":"vgl","status":"named","txHash":"0xdb3b3fd2a22c1dcd92324445509a43316cac4abdb36a065aaf5da61afb010300","ensName":"vgl.site.identitymd.eth","failure":null,"namedAt":"2026-09-18T05:06:41.151+00:00","repoUrl":"https://github.com/Identity-md/launch-47-workflow-frontend-stage-context","pinnedAt":"2026-09-18T05:05:15.513+00:00","createdAt":"2026-09-18T05:05:03.398+00:00","supersededBy":null}],"title":"Retest the complete swarm by building and launching VolatilityGuard Lab on Sepolia: VolatilityGuardHook, VolatilityGuardToken, independent adversarial review, verified factory deployment with a seeded pool, then a working public swap dapp with explanatory information. Publish real source, receipts, test evidence and the live site.\n\nHook: per-PoolId isolation; bounded observation ring/TWAP and EWMA volatility; adaptive price-deviation limits; rolling volume budget resistant to split swaps; NORMAL/WARMUP/GUARDED/RECOVERY states, stale/low-liquidity handling and deterministic recovery. Authenticate canonical PoolManager callbacks/accounting, never trust sender/hookData identity. Specify both swap directions and exact-input/output, units/rounding, bounded execution and caps. Keep LP exits possible and initialization/warmup non-bricking. Reverts cannot persist breaker transitions. No discretionary admin powers or claim of total MEV protection. Support arbitrary currencies.\n\nVGL: Volatility Guard Lab, 18 decimals, no constructor args, fixed 10^27 units minted to deployer, no mint backdoor. Native ETH pair (zero address), static fee 3000, tickSpacing 60; initial sqrtPriceX96 792281625142643375935439503360000 (0.00000001 ETH/VGL). Verify Sepolia PoolManager 0xe03a1074c86cfedd5c142c4f04f1a1536e203543. Use only existing verified periphery, no new deployed helper. Workers never receive keys or broadcast deployments.\n\nDeliver pinned/vendored Foundry project, bytecode_hash=none, offline build/test/fmt checks, fuzz/invariant/stress tests for accounting, isolation, manipulation/split volume, unauthorized callbacks, reentrancy, stale history, edge values, recovery and LP exits; report actual counts, gas, failures and limitations. Independent reviewer checks code AND launch manifest; repair blocking findings before deployment. Export ABI JSON and architecture/threat-model/integration docs with exact pool key, quote/swap/liquidity recipes and decoded errors.\n\nAfter verified deployment handoff, build React/Vite/TypeScript + RainbowKit/wagmi/viem in web/, committed relative-base export in dist/. Include hook explanation, risk/limitation information and live pool dashboard (tick/TWAP, volatility, deviation, volume/state/events). Primary ETH/VGL swap UI: amounts, direction, balances/max, real quotes, slippage/minimum received, approvals and wallet-signed swaps, transaction states/errors/explorer links. Support injected wallets without extra credentials. Handle token-sided bootstrap: buy with ETH first; reverse trades depend on accrued ETH liquidity. No fabricated quotes or receipts. Add supported-position exits and clearly labeled simulation demos. Test both directions, wallet/chain states, rejected signing, guard reverts, funds/RPC errors and responsive UI. Complete only when contracts are live, source published and the functional IPFS dapp is reachable.","types":["contracts","sites"],"audits":[],"release":{"status":"cancelled","failure":"Cancelled by operator. Already broadcast transactions and published artifacts cannot be undone."},"research":[],"versions":[],"contracts":[{"id":"d9e75c1c-eecf-474b-a655-8c544985d44a","kind":"univ4_hook","token":{"name":"Volatility Guard Lab","symbol":"VGL"},"status":"live","chainId":11155111,"artifacts":[{"name":"VolatilityGuardHook","role":"hook","txHash":"0x7b0d7e3794652b8cd428d86cad2315b2a17ffb2c76ed8e344275183a751c0bac","address":"0x35fe5cfe50f700dd20e8c43d5bbca11b13ed50c0"},{"name":"VolatilityGuardToken","role":"token","txHash":"0x7b0d7e3794652b8cd428d86cad2315b2a17ffb2c76ed8e344275183a751c0bac","address":"0xb4ae0c9b66e3f39b0947761112e34fe5c22cc4b4"}],"createdAt":"2026-09-18T02:30:13.687+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T03:01:39.818+00:00","launchNumber":45,"parkedReason":null,"sourceCommit":"630008d4cccd0d687325f6fd5a93b3f10458cc26","sourceRepoUrl":"https://github.com/Identity-md/launch-45-volatilityguardhook-volatilityguardtoken"}],"publishedAt":"2026-09-18T05:06:41.151+00:00"}],"pageSize":20,"totalPages":6}